cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "msuiter" in publications use:'
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
title: 'msuiter: Mutational Signature Analysis with a Rust Compute Core'
version: 0.1.0.9000
abstract: Tally, extract and fit mutational signatures across modalities (SBS, DBS,
  indel and beyond). Numerical kernels live in a Rust workspace exposed through a
  stateless FFI, while the R side provides the object model, the engine registry and
  the tidy user interface.
